[12.216504, "o", "  \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m \u001b[32mVenice AI recommendation received:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  Action    :\u001b[0m \u001b[37mhold\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  Confidence:\u001b[0m \u001b[37m90.0%\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mReasoning:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mThe treasury has a sufficient USDC balance and the agent's remaining a\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mllowance is substantial. The allowance spent is relatively low, and th\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37me allowance active status indicates that the agent can continue to ope\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mrate within its designated limits. Given the conservative approach to \u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mrisk management, it's prudent to hold and monitor the current state ra\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mther than taking any action that could potentially introduce unnecessa\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[37mry risk or expenditure.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─  ─\u001b[0m\r\n"]
